<view class="hub-shell">
  <view class="native-top-safe" style="height:{{nativeBarHeight}}px;background:#fff"/>
  <view class="hub-header">
    <view class="hub-brand"><image src="/assets/brand/medtalent-logo.png" mode="aspectFit" class="hub-logo"/><view><text class="brand-title">Medtalent</text><text class="brand-caption">智能体广场</text></view></view>
    <view class="hub-mobile-badge"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/shield-directory-badge.png"/><text>健康科普</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="hub-hero">
    <text class="hub-title">健康知识，随时了解</text>
    <text class="hub-question">选择科普智能体，了解你关心的健康话题</text>
    <view class="hub-search {{searchFocused ? 'is-focused' : ''}}"><image class="search-icon" src="{{icons.search}}"/><view class="search-field"><input value="{{query}}" focus="{{searchFocused}}" bindfocus="focusSearch" bindblur="blurSearch" bindinput="inputQuery" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search" placeholder="搜索健康知识或医生" placeholder-style="color:#748ca2" aria-label="搜索疾病知识、健康主题或医生"/><button wx:if="{{query}}" class="search-clear" bindtap="clearQuery" aria-label="清除搜索内容"><image src="{{icons.clear}}"/></button></view><button bindtap="search">搜索</button></view>
    <view class="hub-disclaimer"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/shield-directory-hero.png"/><text>本平台不提供诊疗服务，仅提供健康科普与一般性建议，回答仅供参考。</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="hub-topics" id="health-topics">
    <view class="hub-heading"><text class="section-title">热门健康主题</text><button class="all-topics {{activeTopic === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-key="all" bindtap="chooseTopic">全部主题 <image class="icon" src="{{icons.topicArrow}}"/></button></view>
    <view class="hub-topic-grid"><button wx:for="{{topics}}" wx:key="key" class="topic-button {{activeTopic === item.key ? 'active' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="chooseTopic" aria-label="{{item.label}}"><image src="{{item.icon}}"/><text>{{item.label}}</text></button></view>
  </view>
  <view class="hub-doctors" id="doctor-agents">
    <view class="hub-heading doctor-heading"><text class="section-title">{{activeTopicLabel ? activeTopicLabel + '智能体' : '健康科普智能体'}}</text><view class="hub-result-meta"><text>{{loading ? '正在加载智能体…' : error ? '目录暂不可用' : filteredDoctors.length + ' 位科普智能体'}}</text><button wx:if="{{query || activeTopic !== 'all'}}" bindtap="clearFilters">清除筛选</button></view></view>
    <view class="hub-empty" wx:if="{{loading}}"><image src="{{icons.brain}}"/><text class="empty-title">正在加载科普智能体</text><text class="empty-copy">正在获取最新发布的智能体目录，请稍候。</text></view>
    <view class="hub-empty" wx:elif="{{error}}"><image src="{{icons.shield}}"/><text class="empty-title">暂时无法加载智能体</text><text class="empty-copy">{{error}}</text><button bindtap="loadDirectory">重新加载</button></view>
    <view class="hub-doctor-grid" wx:elif="{{filteredDoctors.length}}">
      <button wx:for="{{filteredDoctors}}" wx:key="slug" class="hub-doctor-card" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="enterDoctor" aria-label="进入{{item.name}}的健康科普智能体">
        <view class="hub-doctor-portrait" style="background:{{item.portraitBackground}};color:{{item.accent}}"><view wx:if="{{item.portraitUrl}}" class="portrait-image-frame" style="{{item.portraitStyle}}"><image data-slug="{{item.slug}}" src="{{item.portraitUrl}}" mode="scaleToFill" style="{{item.portraitCropStyle}}" bindload="portraitLoaded" binderror="portraitError"/></view><text wx:else>{{item.initial}}</text></view>
        <view class="hub-doctor-copy"><text class="doctor-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="doctor-department" style="color:{{item.accent}}">{{item.department}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.hospital}}" class="doctor-hospital">{{item.hospital}}</text><text class="doctor-focus">{{item.focus}}</text></view>
        <view class="hub-doctor-link">进入智能体 <image class="icon" src="{{icons.arrow}}"/></view>
      </button>
    </view>
    <view class="hub-empty" wx:else><image src="{{icons.emptySearch}}"/><text class="empty-title">{{doctors.length ? '暂未找到匹配内容' : '暂无已发布的智能体'}}</text><text class="empty-copy">{{doctors.length ? '可以换一个健康主题或医生姓名试试。' : '智能体发布后会出现在这里，请稍后再来。'}}</text><button wx:if="{{doctors.length}}" bindtap="clearFilters">查看全部科普智能体</button><button wx:else bindtap="loadDirectory">刷新目录</button></view>
  </view>
  <view class="hub-footer-note"><image class="icon directory-footer-shield" src="/assets/icons/shield-directory-footer.png"/><text>本平台不提供诊疗服务，仅提供健康科普与一般性建议，回答仅供参考。</text></view>
</view>
